2026-09-11T08:06:47.3269895Z #-- debug:      Add debugging flags as specified in DEBUG_* variables
2026-09-11T08:06:47.3270622Z #-- lto:        Add compile flags for building with link time optimization
2026-09-11T08:06:47.3271275Z #-- autodeps:   Automatically add depends/provides
2026-09-11T08:06:47.3271742Z #
2026-09-11T08:06:47.3272297Z OPTIONS=(strip docs !libtool staticlibs emptydirs zipman purge !debug !lto !autodeps)
